# A1_V "Vivec Informants": Caius wants the player at level 3 before he sends
# them to his three informants in Vivec.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from a1_v_conditioning
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Still under level 3, Caius has nothing yet.
case a1_v_conditioning
run
player->PositionCell -35 -110 80 180 "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House"
until 600 GetPCCell "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House" == 1
talk caius cosades
ask Orders
expect GetJournalIndex A1_V_VivecInformants == 0
bye
end

# The freelance adventuring he asks for: sword practice earns two levels of
# experience, each level is taken in Skyrim's skills menu (advlevel), and
# Morrowind's attribute step follows it.
case a1_v_levels
console player.advskill onehanded 3000
console player.advlevel
pick Strength
pick Endurance
pick Agility
pick OK
console player.advlevel
pick Strength
pick Endurance
pick Agility
pick OK
until 300 player->GetLevel >= 3
end

# Now the orders: three informants, the written details and 200 drakes.
case a1_v_orders
talk caius cosades
ask Orders
expect GetJournalIndex A1_V_VivecInformants == 1
expect player->GetItemCount bk_a1_v_vivecinformants == 1
bye
end
